WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.901
♪♪

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.667
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.133
President Biden today spoke with

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:10.701
allies and partners
about the situation in Ukraine.

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:12.801
Next he'll speak with
Republicans.

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:14.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:17.033
After the U.S. offered
over the weekend to evacuate

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.767
Ukrainian President Volodymyr
Zelenskyy -- excuse me --

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:22.067
amid the Russian invasion,
Zelenskyy reportedly said,

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:25.534
"The fight is here.
I need ammunition, not a ride."

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:28.734
Oh, man, how badly does Biden
wish that quote was his?

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:30.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:34.267
It's like Zelenskyy said, "Come
with me if you want to live."

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:38.067
If Zelenskyy gets to fight
on top of a train,

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.334
he's officially living
Biden's best life.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:41.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:43.234
"I'm the Amtrak guy!"

00:00:43.234 --> 00:00:45.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:48.434
During his keynote speech
on Saturday at CPAC,

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.868
former President Trump said that
the country has

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:53.334
"lost its self-confidence
under President Biden."

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:54.567
Well, of course.

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.968
We all had more self-confidence
under you.

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:58.634
Do you know how affirming it is

00:00:58.634 --> 00:01:00.968
to be smarter
than the president?

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:02.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:05.968
Waking up every day with a jump
in my step.

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.567
In his soon-to-be-released book,

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:11.968
former President Trump's
Attorney General William Barr

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:15.601
said, "Trump cared only about
one thing -- himself.

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:17.868
Country and principle
took second place."

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.734
I don't know, dude. Second?

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:20.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:22.934
I think country took fifth place

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:25.434
and principle broke its leg
and had to be shot.

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:26.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:29.667
"We can't save principle."

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.934
In the same book, Barr
criticized Trump and said,

00:01:31.934 --> 00:01:33.901
"People are worthwhile to Trump

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:36.601
only as a means to his ends,
as utensils."

00:01:36.601 --> 00:01:38.033
Said Trump, "That's a lie.

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:39.801
I've never used a utensil
in my life."

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:41.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.534
Ahead of tomorrow's
State of the Union address,

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.834
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
is lifting the chamber's

00:01:45.834 --> 00:01:48.968
mask mandate, which is
concerning to many House members

00:01:48.968 --> 00:01:50.667
who still need them
for attention.

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:53.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:56.234
A Ukrainian brewery
has reportedly switched

00:01:56.234 --> 00:01:59.601
from producing craft beers to
making Molotov cocktails

00:01:59.601 --> 00:02:01.267
to help fight
the Russian military.

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:03.100
Though, if you really want to
slow down the Russians,

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.934
just give them the craft beer.

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:06.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.200
"Oh, I felt like I ate
a loaf of bread."

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.934 --> 00:02:12.234
"Pumpernickel?"

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:14.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.634
Lawmakers in Florida last week
passed the so-called

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:19.534
"don't say gay" bill, which
prohibits classroom discussions

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:21.801
about sexual orientation
or gender identity.

00:02:21.801 --> 00:02:23.667
Pretty soon,
a Florida school day

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:26.167
is just going to be seven hours
of quiet time.

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:28.934
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:31.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:34.701
Nothing more ironic than
when the "quiet time" punch line

00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:37.267
gets the quietest response.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.267 --> 00:02:38.667
Maybe they were honoring it.

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:42.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:45.033
New York Mayor Eric Adams
announced yesterday that

00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:46.767
beginning next week,
the city will no longer

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:48.934
require vaccine passports
at restaurants,

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:51.601
which is great news for all the
restaurants who already stopped

00:02:51.601 --> 00:02:53.033
checking them three weeks ago.

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:54.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.467
And finally, a dog house
that was struck by a meteorite

00:02:57.467 --> 00:02:59.901
sold last week for $44,000.

00:02:59.901 --> 00:03:02.167
Even crazier, it sold on Zillow.

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:03.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.601
♪♪

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:07.033
President Biden tonight
delivered his first

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:08.234
State of the Union address,

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:11.534
and thank God he got that
Supreme Court justice in,

00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:15.100
'cause there was not much else
to talk about.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:18.701
[ As Biden ]
Uh, I think there's a new
"Batman" movie this week.

00:03:18.701 --> 00:03:20.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.234 --> 00:03:22.067
The New York Times
published a report yesterday

00:03:22.067 --> 00:03:24.200
that U.S. officials
are currently debating

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.934
Russian President Vladimir
Putin's grip on reality.

00:03:26.934 --> 00:03:30.834
In related news, Putin just
ordered troops into Hogwarts.

00:03:30.834 --> 00:03:32.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.934 --> 00:03:34.000
When asked by a reporter

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.701
at a Black History Month
event yesterday

00:03:35.701 --> 00:03:38.133
if Americans should be worried
about nuclear war,

00:03:38.133 --> 00:03:39.767
President Biden said no.

00:03:39.767 --> 00:03:40.701
Yeah, come on.

00:03:40.701 --> 00:03:41.968
Putin isn't gonna bomb

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:44.267
the only people
still supporting him.

00:03:44.267 --> 00:03:46.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.501 --> 00:03:48.701
That's right, President Biden
was asked if Americans

00:03:48.701 --> 00:03:51.167
should be worried about
nuclear war, and he said no.

00:03:51.167 --> 00:03:54.868
But then the CDC said yes,
and the FDA said,

00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:57.133
"We'll let you know
in four to six weeks,"

00:03:57.133 --> 00:03:59.501
so I don't know
what's gonna happen.

00:03:59.501 --> 00:04:02.400
Officials in Ukraine last week
asked Apple CEO Tim Cook

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.901
to ban Russia from using the
company's products and services

00:04:05.901 --> 00:04:07.801
in response
to their attack on Ukraine.

00:04:07.801 --> 00:04:09.534
Well, if being the only country

00:04:09.534 --> 00:04:12.167
whose messages in the group chat
are green

00:04:12.167 --> 00:04:14.834
doesn't force Russia
to surrender,

00:04:14.834 --> 00:04:16.400
I don't know what will.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.501
[ Russian accent ]
This is embarrassment.

00:04:19.501 --> 00:04:20.400
We are only green.

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:24.000
No one even read these texts.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.801
[ Normal voice ]
The Senate last night failed

00:04:29.801 --> 00:04:31.934
to pass the Women's Health
Protection Act,

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:34.634
and West Virginia Senator Joe
Manchin voted with Republicans.

00:04:34.634 --> 00:04:37.267
Okay, how many times does
someone have to vote

00:04:37.267 --> 00:04:39.767
with Republicans before
you consider him a Republican?

00:04:39.767 --> 00:04:41.934
It's kind of like saying
Keith Richards played

00:04:41.934 --> 00:04:43.200
with the Rolling Stones again.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.734
Yeah,
'cause he's a Rolling Stone.

00:04:46.734 --> 00:04:49.200
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi told
reporters yesterday

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.667
that Congress will support
"whatever it is"

00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:54.267
the Ukraine needs amid Russia's
invasion of the country.

00:04:54.267 --> 00:04:57.734
Well, unless
it's universal healthcare,

00:04:57.734 --> 00:05:01.200
in which case there's all --
there's a copay, it's a mess.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.567
New Orleans held its first

00:05:02.567 --> 00:05:04.467
full-scale
Mardi Gras celebration today

00:05:04.467 --> 00:05:07.267
since 2020, when
the coronavirus pandemic hit,

00:05:07.267 --> 00:05:10.067
but required masks
in indoor public spaces.

00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:12.133
Still, men were throwing beads

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:14.100
and yelling,
"Show us your chin!"

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:17.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.868
Today was National Pig Day.

00:05:22.868 --> 00:05:25.334
[ Cheering and applause ]
"When isn't it?" asked an --

00:05:25.334 --> 00:05:26.934
What is wrong with you?

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:29.334
[ Laughter ]
Why are you cheering for it

00:05:29.334 --> 00:05:31.267
like you even knew
it was a thing?

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:35.667
I don't understand
that reaction.

00:05:35.667 --> 00:05:37.000
[ Laughter ]

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.834
[ Chuckles ]

00:05:38.834 --> 00:05:41.033
If you cared so much,
why didn't you know?

00:05:43.767 --> 00:05:46.300
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:47.901
I'm gonna tell the joke now,
alright?

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.300
[ Chuckles ]

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:55.000
I told you there should be
a National Pig Day!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.901 --> 00:05:59.601
Today was National Pig Day.

00:05:59.601 --> 00:06:02.667
"When isn't it?"
asked an exhausted Charlotte.

00:06:02.667 --> 00:06:04.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:04.934 --> 00:06:07.868
"This friendship is starting
to feel very one-sided."

00:06:11.334 --> 00:06:14.434
It lost its momentum
a little bit

00:06:14.434 --> 00:06:16.200
when everybody
lost their [bleep] minds

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.634
about National Pig Day.

00:06:17.634 --> 00:06:20.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.234 --> 00:06:21.667
You know what else?

00:06:21.667 --> 00:06:23.334
I bet someone here
had bacon this morning.

00:06:23.334 --> 00:06:24.434
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.434 --> 00:06:26.567
On National Pig Day.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:29.834
[ Chuckles ] You monsters.

00:06:31.968 --> 00:06:33.968
In honor of St. Patrick's Day,
Dunkin' Donuts

00:06:33.968 --> 00:06:35.901
is offering
a shamrock macchiato.

00:06:35.901 --> 00:06:38.934
In a related story, Italy
has declared war on Ireland.

00:06:38.934 --> 00:06:40.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:44.033
That's right,
Dunkin' Donuts is offering

00:06:44.033 --> 00:06:45.434
a shamrock macchiato,

00:06:45.434 --> 00:06:48.234
which is green
and features Irish cream flavor.

00:06:48.234 --> 00:06:50.868
So, look for that
on a sidewalk near you.

00:06:50.868 --> 00:06:52.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:52.834 --> 00:06:54.567
President Biden
last night delivered

00:06:54.567 --> 00:06:57.033
his first
State of the Union address

00:06:57.033 --> 00:07:00.501
and Chuck Schumer could not
figure out when to clap.

00:07:00.501 --> 00:07:02.434
[ Booing ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:07:02.434 --> 00:07:04.601
[ Laughter ]
-The American Rescue Plan

00:07:04.601 --> 00:07:06.234
helped working people.

00:07:06.234 --> 00:07:08.968
-It's like every white guy
at a hip hop show.

00:07:08.968 --> 00:07:10.701
[ Laughter ]
"You're clapping

00:07:10.701 --> 00:07:12.868
on the ones and threes,
Richard!"

00:07:12.868 --> 00:07:14.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.300
During President Biden's

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:16.834
State of the Union address
last night,

00:07:16.834 --> 00:07:19.567
several members of Congress
wore blue and yellow

00:07:19.567 --> 00:07:21.267
in solidarity with Ukraine,

00:07:21.267 --> 00:07:24.100
though I'm not sure everybody
understood the assignment.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:07:27.567 --> 00:07:28.734
During last night's speech,

00:07:28.734 --> 00:07:30.934
Republican Congresswomen
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:07:30.934 --> 00:07:33.400
and Lauren Boebert heckled
and booed President Biden

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.434
on several occasions.

00:07:34.434 --> 00:07:37.067
In their defense,
he is, technically,

00:07:37.067 --> 00:07:38.501
the manager.

00:07:38.501 --> 00:07:40.434
[ Hesitant laughter ]

00:07:42.801 --> 00:07:45.667
And that, technically,
was a joke.

00:07:45.667 --> 00:07:47.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:50.133 --> 00:07:51.300
Technically.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:53.167
[ Laughter ]
During President Biden's

00:07:53.167 --> 00:07:54.767
State of the Union address
last night,

00:07:54.767 --> 00:07:57.767
he accidentally said "Iranian,"
instead of "Ukrainian."

00:07:57.767 --> 00:07:59.667
[ Laughter ]
Well,

00:07:59.667 --> 00:08:03.133
in a speech where he had
to pronounce Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:08:03.133 --> 00:08:06.434
and Ketanji Brown Jackson,
something had to give.

00:08:06.434 --> 00:08:09.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:12.000
According to a new poll,
71% of Americans

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.400
who watched President Biden's
State of the Union address

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.334
had a positive reaction
to the speech,

00:08:16.334 --> 00:08:18.801
but let's be honest --
everyone who would've had

00:08:18.801 --> 00:08:21.200
a negative reaction
was watching "Yellowstone."

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.501
[ Laughter ]

00:08:23.501 --> 00:08:24.534
According to a new survey,

00:08:24.534 --> 00:08:26.634
New York has the highest
median rent price

00:08:26.634 --> 00:08:28.667
for a one-bedroom apartment
in the country.

00:08:28.667 --> 00:08:31.567
Well, yeah, but it's all
about location, location...

00:08:31.567 --> 00:08:33.801
[ Train screeching, rumbling ]

00:08:33.801 --> 00:08:35.734
[ Laughter ]

00:08:35.734 --> 00:08:36.634
...location.

00:08:36.634 --> 00:08:38.400
[ Laughter ]

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:39.934
And, finally,
Major League Baseball

00:08:39.934 --> 00:08:41.267
announced yesterday
that they are

00:08:41.267 --> 00:08:43.734
postponing their
March 31st Opening Day

00:08:43.734 --> 00:08:45.400
and canceling
the first two series

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.167
of regular season baseball,

00:08:47.167 --> 00:08:49.634
after the league could not reach
a bargaining agreement

00:08:49.634 --> 00:08:52.901
with its players' union,
which is bad news for the Mets

00:08:52.901 --> 00:08:55.901
because the regular season is
the only one they got.

00:08:55.901 --> 00:08:57.400
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.100
Defense officials in Ukraine
have warned that the Kremlin

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.968
could be using deepfake videos

00:09:02.968 --> 00:09:04.968
to spread misinformation
to Russians.

00:09:04.968 --> 00:09:08.801
Okay. I knew Putin didn't have
an Iron Man suit.

00:09:08.801 --> 00:09:10.934
[ Laughter ]

00:09:10.934 --> 00:09:13.701
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:09:13.701 --> 00:09:17.033
suggested in a court filing
yesterday that it has evidence

00:09:17.033 --> 00:09:20.501
that former President Trump and
his campaign tried to illegally

00:09:20.501 --> 00:09:22.968
obstruct Congress' counting of
electoral votes.

00:09:22.968 --> 00:09:25.267
Yeah, we know.

00:09:25.267 --> 00:09:26.701
[ Laughter ]

00:09:26.701 --> 00:09:29.634
Watching the House investigate
this thing is like watching

00:09:29.634 --> 00:09:31.901
"The Office"
with your grandmother.

00:09:31.901 --> 00:09:35.534
"I think there's a spark
between Jim and that Pam."

00:09:35.534 --> 00:09:38.467
"Yeah, Grandma, it's Season 6."

00:09:38.467 --> 00:09:40.033
[ Laughter ]

00:09:40.033 --> 00:09:42.334
A bipartisan group of
Congressional lawmakers is

00:09:42.334 --> 00:09:46.467
calling on President Biden to
ban Russian oil and gas imports

00:09:46.467 --> 00:09:48.634
amid the country's invasion
of Ukraine.

00:09:48.634 --> 00:09:51.367
The bill has support from
both sides of the aisle

00:09:51.367 --> 00:09:55.300
and the aisle.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.667
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday told several students

00:09:58.667 --> 00:10:01.701
standing behind him at an indoor
event that they did not need to

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:05.133
wear face masks and said,
"Honestly, it's not doing

00:10:05.133 --> 00:10:07.767
anything and we've got to stop
with this COVID theater."

00:10:07.767 --> 00:10:10.534
Although for people who moved
from New York to Florida

00:10:10.534 --> 00:10:13.734
during the pandemic, "That's the
only theater they have left."

00:10:13.734 --> 00:10:17.467
[ Laughter ]

00:10:17.467 --> 00:10:20.167
"Can you believe what they call
bagels down there?"

00:10:20.167 --> 00:10:23.100
[ Laughter ]

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.100
I'm doing the Gilded Age
New York.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:28.901
[ Laughter ]

00:10:28.901 --> 00:10:30.868
"You call this a subway?"

00:10:30.868 --> 00:10:33.234
[ Laughter ]

00:10:33.234 --> 00:10:36.100
Authorities in Germany yesterday
reportedly seized

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:39.067
a Russian billionaire's
$600 million mega yacht.

00:10:39.067 --> 00:10:41.767
Said the billionaire,
"Oh, no, my backup yacht."

00:10:41.767 --> 00:10:43.767
[ Laughter ]

00:10:43.767 --> 00:10:46.667
Nike announced this week that
it's temporarily closing

00:10:46.667 --> 00:10:48.367
its online store in Russia.

00:10:48.367 --> 00:10:51.133
Apparently, it was giving Putin
some bad ideas.

00:10:51.133 --> 00:10:55.734
[ Laughter ]
[ Audience oohs ]

00:10:55.734 --> 00:10:58.901
Luxury brand Bulgari said
this week that its sales

00:10:58.901 --> 00:11:01.534
have increased
since the Ukrainian invasion

00:11:01.534 --> 00:11:04.734
as wealthy Russians are buying
jewelry amid a collapse

00:11:04.734 --> 00:11:06.067
of Russia's currency.

00:11:06.067 --> 00:11:09.400
On the plus side, it does make
oligarchs easier to spot.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:13.601
[ Laughter ]

00:11:13.601 --> 00:11:15.200
A crown?

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.501
[ Laughter ]

00:11:17.501 --> 00:11:20.634
IKEA has announced it will
temporarily pause manufacturing

00:11:20.634 --> 00:11:23.267
and retail operations
in Russia and Belarus

00:11:23.267 --> 00:11:26.601
due to the invasion of Ukraine,
while IKEA in Ukraine is opening

00:11:26.601 --> 00:11:28.167
their doors to Russian soldiers

00:11:28.167 --> 00:11:29.968
and hoping they can't find
their way out.

00:11:29.968 --> 00:11:32.667
[ Laughter ]

00:11:32.667 --> 00:11:35.667
Amazon confirmed yesterday that
it plans to shut down

00:11:35.667 --> 00:11:37.000
all of its physical bookstores.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.667
They're getting back to doing
what originally

00:11:38.667 --> 00:11:39.868
made them successful --

00:11:39.868 --> 00:11:41.934
putting physical bookstores
out of business.

00:11:41.934 --> 00:11:43.934
[ Laughter ]

00:11:43.934 --> 00:11:47.868
A JetBlue pilot blew twice the
legal limit on a breathalyzer

00:11:47.868 --> 00:11:50.634
yesterday after being removed
from the cockpit of a plane.

00:11:50.634 --> 00:11:54.067
They were immediately suspicious
since the flight was Delta.

00:11:54.067 --> 00:11:55.968
[ Laughter ]

00:11:55.968 --> 00:11:57.400
What are you doing in here?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.501
"Oh, let's get this puppy
in the air!

00:11:59.501 --> 00:12:01.801
[ Laughter ]
Where are we headed?!"

00:12:04.834 --> 00:12:07.033
Tomorrow is National Sons Day.

00:12:07.033 --> 00:12:11.467
Said dads, "What did I get you?

00:12:11.467 --> 00:12:13.133
What did I get you?

00:12:13.133 --> 00:12:16.534
How about a roof over your head,
wiseguy?

00:12:16.534 --> 00:12:19.501
What did I get you?"

00:12:19.501 --> 00:12:22.567
[ Laughter ]

00:12:22.567 --> 00:12:24.734
Really good dad.

00:12:24.734 --> 00:12:27.801
And finally, New York Governor
Kathy Hochul yesterday unveiled

00:12:27.801 --> 00:12:30.834
plans to permanently allow bars
and restaurants to offer

00:12:30.834 --> 00:12:32.567
to-go alcoholic drinks.

00:12:32.567 --> 00:12:35.701
So say hello to New York City's
newest mascot,

00:12:35.701 --> 00:12:37.067
Martini Rat.

00:12:37.067 --> 00:12:40.100
[ Laughter and cheers ]

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.868
"Well, they certainly don't have
that in Florida, do they?

00:12:42.868 --> 00:12:44.067
[ Laughter ]

00:12:44.067 --> 00:12:45.968
Oh, no, Slurpee Rat.

00:12:45.968 --> 00:12:47.801
That's the best
they can do there."
[ Laughter ]

00:12:47.801 --> 00:12:51.400
♪♪

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.801
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

